        "raw": "<p>Suppose a Living Force Field Generator is protecting a Blade Battalion and both are attacked by an area attack.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>1) Does the Living Force Field protect itself? (I wouldn&#39;t think so)</p><p>2) If the Living Force Field is destroyed by the area attack and _then_ the Blade Battalion is targeted by that same area attack, does the Living Force Field protect the Blade Battalion? (I wouldn&#39;t think so for this one, either)</p>",
