        "user_title": null,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "[quote=\"arenson9\"]\n\nSuppose a Living Force Field Generator is protecting a Blade Battalion and both are attacked by an area attack.&nbsp;1) Does the Living Force Field protect itself? (I wouldn&#39;t think so)2) If the Living Force Field is destroyed by the area attack and _then_ the Blade Battalion is targeted by that same area attack, does the Living Force Field protect the Blade Battalion? (I wouldn&#39;t think so for this one, either)\n\n[/quote]\n\n&nbsp;\n\nLiving Force Field protects allies, but not itself. Two Living Force Fields can protect each other though.\n\n&nbsp;\n\nActive player makes timing decisions when simultaneous events occur. If the active player attacks (and kills) the Living Force Field before attacking the Blade Battalion, the Blade Battalion won&#39;t have the defense bonus.\n",
